        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#D8450C" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.6px">IT'S GAME DAY</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 10px" color="#081B35" font-size="30px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.1">South Carolina at No. 16 Florida</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px" color="#33425C" font-size="16px" line-height="1.5">Kickoff is 12:45 p.m. ET on SEC Network, Homecoming and the 500th game in The Swamp. Your free GatorBait Game Day program has both rosters, the matchup, the injury report, our picks and the SEC slate. Print it, fold it, take it in.</mj-text>
